{"new":"42,000৳","old":"43,000৳","single":"","tax":"Ex Tax: 42,000৳","discounts":[]},"request":false,"askText":"","stepperHidden":false,"productId":"782","features":{"title":"Key Features","items":[{"h":"Model: EPOLT-3304-4TE-2AC-L3","c":[]},{"h":"EPON Ports: 4 × EPON PON Ports","c":[]},{"h":"Uplink Ports: 4 × Gigabit RJ45 + 4 × SFP/SFP+","c":[]},{"h":"EPON Standard: IEEE 802.3ah","c":[]},{"h":"PON Speed: 1.25 Gbps Upstream / 1.25 Gbps Downstream","c":[]},{"h":"Maximum ONUs: 256 (64 per PON Port)","c":[]},{"h":"Transmission Distance: Up to 20 km","c":[]},{"h":"Optical Connector: SC/UPC","c":[]},{"h":"Management: Web GUI, CLI, SNMP, SSH, Telnet","c":[]},{"h":"Installation: 1U Rack Mount","c":[]},{"h":"Warranty: 01 Year","c":[]}],"noExpand":false},"tabs":[{"title":"Description","active":true,"cls":"tab-2","noExpand":false,"kind":"description","html":"\n                <p>The DM (Digital Media) EPOLT-3304-4TE-2AC-L3 4-Port EPON OLT is a high-performance Layer 3 Optical Line Terminal designed for Internet Service Providers (ISPs), telecom operators, enterprise campuses, and Fiber-to-the-Home (FTTH) deployments. Built in a compact 1U rack-mount chassis, it delivers reliable EPON access with advanced routing, switching, and management capabilities.</p><p><br></p><p>The OLT features 4 EPON PON ports, 4 Gigabit RJ45 uplink ports, and 4 SFP/SFP+ uplink slots, providing flexible connectivity for growing fiber networks. It supports up to 256 ONUs (64 ONUs per PON port) and offers a transmission distance of up to 20 km, making it ideal for residential broadband, enterprise connectivity, IPTV, VoIP, and Triple-Play services.</p><p><br></p><p>With comprehensive Layer 2 and Layer 3 networking features, including VLAN, QoS, ACL, Static Routing, RIP, OSPF, IGMP Snooping, DHCP Server/Relay, and multiple management options such as Web GUI, CLI, SNMP, SSH, and Telnet, the EPOLT-3304-4TE-2AC-L3 provides secure, scalable, and efficient fiber access for modern EPON networks.</p><p><br></p><h3>Key Features</h3><p><br></p><ul><li>4 × EPON PON Ports</li><li>4 × Gigabit RJ45 Uplink Ports</li><li>4 × SFP/SFP+ Uplink Slots</li><li>Layer 3 Routing Functions</li><li>Supports Up to 256 ONUs (64 per PON Port)</li><li>IEEE 802.3ah EPON Standard</li><li>20 km Fiber Transmission Distance</li><li>VLAN, QoS, ACL &amp; DHCP Support</li><li>IGMP Snooping for IPTV</li><li>Static Route, RIP v1/v2 &amp; OSPF Support</li><li>Web GUI, CLI, SNMP, SSH &amp; Telnet Management</li><li>1U Rack-Mount Design</li></ul>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"VSOL V1600D4-DP EPON OLT 4 PORT 10G UPLINK","href":"/vsol-v1600d4-dp-epon-olt-4-port-10g-uplink","now":"43,000৳","old":"48,000৳","single":""},{"name":"ECOM E08EP-4S+ 8-Port EPON OLT Without 4 PON Card","href":"/ecom-e08ep-4s-8-port-epon-olt-without-4-pon-card","now":"39,500৳","old":"42,000৳","single":""},{"name":"VSOL V1600D8 8-Port EPON OLT","href":"/vsol-v1600d8-8-port-epon-olt","now":"75,000৳","old":"76,500৳","single":""},{"name":"VSOL V1601E02-DP 2Port EPON OLT 10G UPLINK","href":"/V.SOL%20V1601E02-DP%202Port%20EPON%20OLT","now":"31,500৳","old":"36,000৳","single":""},{"name":"VSOL V1600D16 16-Port EPON OLT","href":"/vsol-v1600d16-16-port-epon-olt","now":"150,000৳","old":"155,000৳","single":""},{"name":"ECOM E08EP-4S+ 8 Port EPON OLT With 8 PON Card","href":"/ecom-e08ep-4s-8-port-epon-olt-with-8-pon-card","now":"59,000৳","old":"65,000৳","single":""},{"name":"VSOL V3600D8 8 Port 10G 1:256 Ratio EPON OLT","href":"/vsol-v3600d8-8-port-10g-1256-ratio-epon-olt","now":"345,000৳","old":"358,000৳","single":""},{"name":"ECOM E04EP-4S+RM 4-Port EPON OLT with 10G SFP+ Uplink – Rack Mount","href":"/ecom-e04ep-4srm-4-port-epon-olt-with-10g-sfp-uplink%E2%80%93rack-mount","now":"34,500৳","old":"35,300৳","single":""},{"name":"HSGQ-XE08R 8-Port EPON OLT","href":"/hsgq-xe08r-8-port-epon-olt","now":"56,000৳","old":"5